---
layout: layouts/page.njk
permalink: /contact/thank-you/
title: "Enquiry received"
heading: "Thank you — your enquiry is with us."
description: "Your enquiry has reached Geosustara Enviro Services LLP. We will reply within one working day."
lede: "We have your message. Here is what happens next."
noindex: true
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
breadcrumbs:
  - text: Home
    url: /
  - text: Contact
    url: /contact/
  - text: Enquiry received
---
{%- from "partials/icons.njk" import arrow -%}
{#- Deliberately noindex: this page only makes sense arriving from a submitted form, and an
    indexed "thank you" page competes with /contact/ for the firm's own brand terms.
    It is a real URL rather than an inline message so a conversion goal can be attached to
    it later without touching the form. -#}

<section class="sec">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="thanks rv">
      <span class="tick" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" focusable="false"><path d="m4 12.5 5 5L20 6.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      </span>

      <h2 class="sec-title" style="margin-top:0">What happens next</h2>
      <ol class="next-steps">
        <li>We read the enquiry and check whether anything obvious is missing — location, the obligation,
          the deadline you are working to.</li>
        <li>You get a reply, normally within one working day, saying what the work involves and what we
          would need from you to scope it properly.</li>
        <li>Where the scope is not clear from a description — which is most site work — we suggest a short
          site visit before anything is quoted.</li>
      </ol>

      <p style="margin-top:28px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.78">
        If it is urgent, do not wait for the email. Call
        {%- for p in site.contact.phones %}
        <a href="tel:{{ p.e164 }}" style="color:var(--brand)">{{ p.display }}</a>{% if not loop.last %} or{% endif %}
        {%- endfor %}, or send the same details on
        <a href="https://wa.me/{{ site.contact.whatsapp }}" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--brand)">WhatsApp</a>.
      </p>

      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a class="btn mag" href="{{ '/services/' | url }}">Browse our services {{ arrow() }}</a>
        <a class="btn btn--out mag" href="{{ '/insights/' | url }}">Read our notes {{ arrow() }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
